CHIP MATRIX MACH111
PIN 10 A
PIN 32 B
PIN 14 C
PIN 15 D
PIN 16 E
PIN 17 F
PIN 11 CLK
PIN 2 Q0 REG
PIN 3 Q1 REG
PIN 4 Q2 REG
PIN 5 Q3 
EQUATIONS
Q0=D*E+A*B*/C*/E+/C*F+B*C*/F+C*/F+B*C*/D*E+A*/B*/C*/F
Q0.CLKF=CLK
Q1.T=/A*/B*D*/F+/A*C*D+B*C*E*/F+A*/C*D*/F+B*C*/F+/C*D+/E*/F
Q1.CLKF=CLK
Q2=(C*D*E*/F+/A*C*/D+/C*/D*F+/C*E+C*D*E+B*F+/A*B*E*/F) :+: F
Q2.CLKF=CLK
Q3=B*C*D+/A*/B*E*F+A*/C*D*E+/B*D*E*/F+/C*/D+/B*C*/D+B*D*/E*F
